m-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Fees came to KSh 1,486, KSh +366 more than August. Fuliza accounted for KSh 234 over 3 days before payday.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Moved, not spent</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><thead><tr><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left">Movement</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">To M-Shwari</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 20,000</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Cash withdrawn</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto,