ht:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">A new place: Carrefour Two Rivers</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 3,100 over two visits, filed under groceries.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Where the money could go differently</p><ol style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;padding-left:24px"><li style="margin-top:8px">Moving KSh 20,000 to M-Shwari on payday, before the rent, would have kept M-Pesa out of Fuliza.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Eating out was KSh 7,310. Two fewer Java House visits a month is roughly KSh 2,980.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Transport at KSh 11,460 was the third-largest category after rent and groceries.</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Year to date in</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#1E7F5C;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 870,400</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Year to date out</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 792,150</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Year to date fees</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#B7791F;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 10,420</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Year to date saved</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#6B7A8F;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 135,000</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Three things to watch in October</p><ol style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;padding-left:24px"><li style="margin-top:8px">Rent of KSh 22,000 is expected on 1 October.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Transport and eating out both went over budget; October starts from zero.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">5 messages could not be read. Teach Hesabu what they were.</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:48px;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:16px">Every number is computed from your money messages. Nothing is estimated.</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:8px">Accounts covered: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Messages Hesabu could not read: 5</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><a href="https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture" sty