`;

exports[`HTML outputs for monthly-en > email HTML is table-based with cid images and a text twin 2`] = `
"Hesabu, Monthly report, September 2026

Your September in money
-----------------------

Rent and housing                KSh 22,000
Groceries                       KSh 18,240
Family and friends              KSh 12,000
Transport                       KSh 11,460
Utilities                        KSh 8,199
Eating out                       KSh 7,310
Everything else                 KSh 15,981
Total spent                     KSh 95,190
KSh 6,250 more than last month

You spent 7% more than in August and still put KSh 20,000 into M-Shwari.

Money in: KSh 104,350 (KSh +3,150)
Money out: KSh 95,190 (KSh +6,250)
Fees: KSh 1,486 (KSh +366)
Saved: KSh 20,000

Spending has climbed for two months while income edged up
Three lines over six months, April to September, for money in, money out and net. Income rose from KSh 92,400 to KSh 104,350. Spending rose from KSh 84,210 to KSh 95,190. Net was highest in August at KSh 11,140 and KSh 7,674 in September, which is highlighted.

Income beat spending by KSh 7,674 after fees
Two bars compare September and August. September: KSh 104,350 in, KSh 95,190 out, net KSh 7,674. August: KSh 101,200 in, KSh 88,940 out, net KSh 11,140.

Rent and groceries took 23% and 19% of the month
A waterfall from KSh 104,350 income down through rent KSh 22,000, groceries KSh 18,240, family and friends KSh 12,000, transport KSh 11,460, utilities KSh 8,199, other categories and fees KSh 1,486, ending at KSh 7,674 net.

Rent is 23% of spending; health more than doubled
Donut of KSh 95,190 spending by category. Rent and housing KSh 22,000 (23%), groceries KSh 18,240 (19%), family and friends KSh 12,000 (13%), transport KSh 11,460 (12%), utilities KSh 8,199 (9%), eating out KSh 7,310 (8%), the remaining four categories make up the rest.

Where it went
-------------
Rent and housing  |  KSh 22,000  |  23%  |  KSh 0
Groceries  |  KSh 18,240  |  19%  |  KSh +1,340
Family and friends  |  KSh 12,000  |  13%  |  KSh +2,500
Transport  |  KSh 11,460  |  12%  |  KSh +1,260
Utilities  |  KSh 8,199  |  9%  |  KSh +1,099
Eating out  |  KSh 7,310  |  8%  |  KSh +470
Other  |  KSh 5,491  |  6%  |  KSh -2,709
Health  |  KSh 4,200  |  4%  |  KSh +2,400
Airtime and data  |  KSh 3,650  |  4%  |  KSh -250
Entertainment  |  KSh 2,640  |  3%  |  KSh +140
Total  |  KSh 95,190  |    |  KSh +6,250

Rent day was the spendiest at KSh 24,350; most days sat near KSh 3,173
Thirty bars, one per day of September, against an average line at KSh 3,173. The 1st stands out at KSh 24,350 because of rent, and the 28th at KSh 6,920 on payday.

Weekends were a little heavier than weekdays
A September calendar shaded by daily spending. Darkest on the 1st (KSh 24,350) and the 28th (KSh 6,920); Saturdays and Sundays slightly darker than the weekdays around them.

After rent, Naivas was the biggest merchant at KSh 9,860
Horizontal bars for the top eight merchants. Mwangi Properties KSh 22,000, Naivas Westlands KSh 9,860, Total Energies Parklands KSh 5,400, Matatu and boda (cash) KSh 5,160, Mama Mboga Kangemi KSh 4,180, KPLC prepaid KSh 4,000, Safaricom KSh 3,650, Carrefour Two Rivers KSh 3,100 (new).

People
------
Mum  |  KSh 9,000  |  KSh 0
Brian Otieno  |  KSh 3,000  |  KSh 0
Jane Wanjiru  |  KSh 0  |  KSh 3,500

Income by source
----------------
Jambo Logistics Ltd  |  KSh 85,000  |  1
Kamau Hardware  |  KSh 14,600  |  2
Jane Wanjiru  |  KSh 3,500  |  1
Jumia  |  KSh 1,250  |  1
Total  |  KSh 104,350  |  

Fees were 2% of spending, up 33% on August
A short ruled bar: fees of KSh 1,486 are 2% of KSh 95,190 spent.

> Fees came to KSh 1,486, KSh +366 more than August. Fuliza accounted for KSh 234 over 3 days before payday.

Moved, not spent
----------------
To M-Shwari  |  KSh 20,000
Cash withdrawn  |  KSh 7,000
Loans repaid  |  KSh 5,400
Everything moved between your accounts, including the salary transfer from KCB to M-Pesa  |  KSh 67,000

> You saved 19% of what came in, up from 17% in August. M-Shwari now holds KSh 43,000.

Transport and eating out went over; groceries held
Four budget bars for September. Groceries KSh 18,240 of KSh 20,000. Transport KSh 11,460 of KSh 10,000, over. Eating out KSh 7,310 of KSh 6,000, over. Family and friends KSh 12,000 of KSh 12,000, exactly on the limit.

Bills expected in October
-------------------------
Mwangi Properties (rent)  |  KSh 22,000  |  1 October
Nairobi Water  |  KSh 1,200  |  8 October
Safaricom Home Fibre  |  KSh 2,999  |  15 October
Netflix  |  KSh 1,100  |  20 October
KPLC prepaid  |  KSh 2,000  |  24 October

M-Pesa dipped into Fuliza for 3 days before payday
M-Pesa balance across September, falling through the month to below zero around the 25th and recovering to KSh 7,890 after the salary transfer on the 28th.

KCB ended the month at KSh 48,440
KCB balance across September, stepping down with rent and card payments and jumping to KSh 48,440 on the 28th when the salary of KSh 85,000 landed.

When you spend
--------------
Morning  |  KSh 21,340  |  28
Afternoon  |  KSh 38,910  |  41
Evening  |  KSh 29,480  |  36
Night  |  KSh 5,460  |  7

Worth knowing
-------------
- Highest income month since April
  KSh 104,350 came in, including KSh 85,000 from Jambo Logistics Ltd and KSh 14,600 from Kamau Hardware.
- Fuliza cost KSh 234 in the last week
  You drew KSh 3,900 across 3 days and repaid it on payday. Moving part of the salary transfer earlier would avoid the charge.
- Health spending rose to KSh 4,200
  A visit to Aga Khan University Hospital and two pharmacy runs. Hesabu filed the hospital under health; change it if that is wrong.
- Transport finished 115% of its budget
  KSh 11,460 against KSh 10,000. Fuel at Total Energies was KSh 5,400 of it.
- KSh 67,000 moved between your own accounts
  None of it is counted as spending. KSh 20,000 went to M-Shwari and KSh 7,000 came out as cash.
- A new place: Carrefour Two Rivers
  KSh 3,100 over two visits, filed under groceries.

Where the money could go differently
------------------------------------
1. Moving KSh 20,000 to M-Shwari on payday, before the rent, would have kept M-Pesa out of Fuliza.
2. Eating out was KSh 7,310. Two fewer Java House visits a month is roughly KSh 2,980.
3. Transport at KSh 11,460 was the third-largest category after rent and groceries.

Year to date in: KSh 870,400
Year to date out: KSh 792,150
Year to date fees: KSh 10,420
Year to date saved: KSh 135,000

Three things to watch in October
--------------------------------
1. Rent of KSh 22,000 is expected on 1 October.
2. Transport and eating out both went over budget; October starts from zero.
3. 5 messages could not be read. Teach Hesabu what they were.

Every number is computed from your money messages. Nothing is estimated.
Accounts covered: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari
Messages Hesabu could not read: 5

Full report: https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for monthly-en > hero HTML carries the tally, three insight lines and the donut 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Your September in money</title>
<style>
@font-face {…}
@font-face {…}
:root, [data-theme="light"] {
  --h-paper: #F3F5F7;
  --h-sheet: #FFFFFF;
  --h-rule: #C9D2DC;
  --h-ink: #141E2E;
  --h-ink-soft: #5B6878;
  --h-biro: #1F4FD8;
  --h-on-biro: #FFFFFF;
  --h-in: #1E7F5C;
  --h-out: #141E2E;
  --h-fee: #B7791F;
  --h-transfer: #6B7A8F;
  --h-warn: #A23B2A;
  --h-other: #DCE2E9;
  --h-average: #5B6878;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #141E2E;
  --h-cat-2: #1F4FD8;
  --h-cat-3: #5B6878;
  --h-cat-4: #7B93E8;
  --h-cat-5: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-6: #C2CCF5;
  color-scheme: light;
}
[data-theme="dark"] {
  --h-paper: #101722;
  --h-sheet: #17202D;
  --h-rule: #2A3443;
  --h-ink: #E8ECF1;
  --h-ink-soft: #9AA6B5;
  --h-biro: #6D8DFF;
  --h-on-biro: #0B1220;
  --h-in: #4FC08D;
  --h-out: #E8ECF1;
  --h-fee: #E0A43C;
  --h-transfer: #8A98AC;
  --h-warn: #E0705C;
  --h-other: #2F3A4A;
  --h-average: #9AA6B5;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #E8ECF1;
  --h-cat-2: #6D8DFF;
  --h-cat-3: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-4: #A9BBFF;
  --h-cat-5: #6F7C8E;
  --h-cat-6: #4A5CA8;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
  --h-paper: #101722;
  --h-sheet: #17202D;
  --h-rule: #2A3443;
  --h-ink: #E8ECF1;
  --h-ink-soft: #9AA6B5;
  --h-biro: #6D8DFF;
  --h-on-biro: #0B1220;
  --h-in: #4FC08D;
  --h-out: #E8ECF1;
  --h-fee: #E0A43C;
  --h-transfer: #8A98AC;
  --h-warn: #E0705C;
  --h-other: #2F3A4A;
  --h-average: #9AA6B5;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #E8ECF1;
  --h-cat-2: #6D8DFF;
  --h-cat-3: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-4: #A9BBFF;
  --h-cat-5: #6F7C8E;
  --h-cat-6: #4A5CA8;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}

html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body { font-family: var(--h-font); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; background: var(--h-paper); color: var(--h-ink); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
.h-page { min-height: 100vh; background: var(--h-paper); color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-page--report { padding: 0; }
@media (min-width: 720px) { .h-page--report { padding: 32px 16px; } }


.h-chart { margin: 0; max-width: 100%; }
.h-chart__caption { display: block; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.h-chart__title { display: block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-chart__takeaway { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-chart__plot { overflow: visible; }
.h-chart__plot svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.h-chart__data { margin-top: 8px; }
.h-chart__toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-biro); list-style: none; }
.h-chart__toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.h-chart__toggle::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-right: 8px; border-right: 2px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; transform: rotate(-45deg); transition: transform 180ms; }
.h-chart__data[open] > .h-chart__toggle::before { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.h-chart__toggle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.h-ledger { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger th, .h-ledger td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); text-align: left; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; }
.h-ledger th { color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-ledger thead th { font-size: 14px; }
.h-ledger tbody th { color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger .h-num { text-align: right; }
.h-ledger td.h-num { white-space: nowrap; }
.h-ledger td + td, .h-ledger th + th, .h-ledger th + td { padding-left: 12px; }
.h-ledger .h-total th, .h-ledger .h-total td { font-weight: 700; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-ink); border-bottom: 3px double var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger--compact { font-size: 14px; }
.h-ledger--compact th, .h-ledger--compact td { padding: 8px 0; }
.h-visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .h-chart__toggle::before { transition: none; } }
@media print { .h-chart__data { display: none; } }


.h-report { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 24px 48px; background: var(--h-sheet); color: var(--h-ink); font-family: var(--h-font); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; border-radius: 8px; }
.h-report a { color: var(--h-biro); }
.h-report :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; }
.h-num { text-align: right; }
/* Figures stay proportional: this font's tnum also widens the comma, which reads as "2 , 840". Alignment comes from the right edge. */
.h-masthead { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; align-items: baseline; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-masthead__brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-masthead__period { margin-left: auto; }
.h-report__title { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.h-hero { margin-top: 24px; }
.h-tally { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
.h-tally__row th, .h-tally__row td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; }
.h-tally__row td.h-num, .h-tally__total td.h-num { text-align: right; }
.h-tally__row td { font-size: 16px; }
.h-tally__label { color: var(--h-ink-soft); font-size: 14px; }
.h-tally__total th, .h-tally__total td { padding: 16px 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-ink); vertical-align: baseline; }
.h-tally__label--total { color: var(--h-ink); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; }
.h-tally__value--total { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.h-tally__rule { height: 0; border-bottom: 3px double var(--h-ink); }
.h-hero__delta { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; }
.h-hero__verdict { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 36em; }
.h-sections { margin-top: 32px; }
.h-table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
.h-table-scroll:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.h-ledger th.h-num { white-space: normal; }
.h-section { margin-top: 32px; }
.h-section__title { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; }
.h-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0 24px; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-rule); }
.h-kpi { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); min-width: 0; }
.h-kpi__label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-kpi__value { margin: 4px 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 8px; }
.h-kpi__amount { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: nowrap; }
.h-kpi[data-tone="in"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-in); }
.h-kpi[data-tone="fee"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-fee); }
.h-kpi[data-tone="transfer"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-transfer); }
.h-kpi__delta { font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-chart-size--phone { display: none; }
.h-insights, .h-watch, .h-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.h-insights { list-style: none; }
.h-insight { margin-top: 16px; }
.h-insight:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.h-insight__headline { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; }
.h-insight__body { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 16px; max-width: 40em; }
.h-list { padding-left: 1.2em; }
.h-list li, .h-watch li { margin-top: 8px; max-width: 40em; }
.h-watch { list-style: none; counter-reset: watch; }
.h-watch li { position: relative; padding-left: 32px; counter-increment: watch; }
.h-watch li::before { content: counter(watch); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--h-biro); color: var(--h-on-biro); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; }
.h-callout { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid var(--h-rule); background: var(--h-paper); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
.h-callout p { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; }
.h-callout--fee { border-left-color: var(--h-fee); }
.h-callout--warn { border-left-color: var(--h-warn); }
.h-footer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-footer__note { margin: 0; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-footer__meta { margin: 12px 0 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.h-footer__meta dt { display: inline; }
.h-footer__meta dt::after { content: ": "; }
.h-footer__meta dd { display: inline; margin: 0; color: var(--h-ink); text-align: left; }
.h-footer__writer { margin: 12px 0 0; }
.h-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--h-biro); color: var(--h-on-biro); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
.h-report a.h-button { color: var(--h-on-biro); }
.h-report--monthly .h-tally__row td { font-size: 16px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) {
  .h-report { padding: 32px 24px 48px; }
  .h-report__title { font-size: 40px; }
  .h-tally__value--total { font-size: 56px; }
  .h-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 719px) {
  .h-report { padding: 16px 16px 32px; border-radius: 0; }
  .h-chart-size--web { display: none; }
  .h-chart-size--phone { display: block; }
}
@keyframes h-row-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
@keyframes h-rule-in { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .h-report--web .h-tally__row, .h-report--web .h-tally__total { animation: h-row-in 300ms both; animation-delay: calc(var(--i, 0) * 30ms); }
  .h-report--web .h-tally__rule { transform-origin: left; animation: h-rule-in 300ms both; animation-delay: calc(var(--rows, 7) * 30ms + 200ms); }
}
@media print {
  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 14mm 16mm; }
  html, body { background: #fff !important; }
  .h-report { max-width: none; padding: 0; border-radius: 0; background: #fff; color: #141E2E; }
  .h-chart-size--phone, .h-chart__data, .h-footer__link, .h-skip { display: none !important; }
  .h-chart-size--web { display: block !important; }
  .h-section, .h-callout, .h-kpis, .h-hero { break-inside: avoid; }
  .h-section__title { break-after: avoid; }
  .h-kpi__amount { font-size: 24px; }
  .h-kpis { gap: 0 16px; }
  .h-tally__row, .h-tally__total, .h-tally__rule { animation: none !important; }
}


.hero { position: relative; width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 72px; background: var(--h-sheet); color: var(--h-ink); font-family: var(--h-font); overflow: hidden; }
.hero__top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
.hero__brand { font-size: 44px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.hero__period { font-size: 30px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.hero__title { margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
.hero__tally { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 32px; }
.hero__tally th, .hero__tally td { padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; text-align: left; }
.hero__tally th { color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.hero__tally td { text-align: right; }
.hero__total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding: 28px 0 20px; border-bottom: 6px double var(--h-ink); }
.hero__total-label { font-size: 30px; }
.hero__total-value { font-size: 104px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.hero__delta { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 32px; width: 520px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 500; }
.hero__insights { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; width: 520px; }
.hero__insights li { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 28px; position: relative; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; overflow: hidden; }
.hero__insights li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--h-biro); }
.hero__donut { position: absolute; right: 72px; bottom: 130px; width: 388px; }
.hero__donut svg { display: block; width: 388px; height: auto; }
.hero__foot { position: absolute; left: 72px; right: 72px; bottom: 72px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-size: 30px; color: var(--h-biro); font-weight: 500; }
.hero__foot span { color: var(--h-ink-soft); font-weight: 400; }

body { background: var(--h-sheet); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero" style="--h-paper:#F3F5F7;--h-sheet:#FFFFFF;--h-rule:#C9D2DC;--h-ink:#141E2E;--h-ink-soft:#5B6878;--h-biro:#1F4FD8;--h-on-biro:#FFFFFF;--h-in:#1E7F5C;--h-out:#141E2E;--h-fee:#B7791F;--h-transfer:#6B7A8F;--h-warn:#A23B2A;--h-other:#DCE2E9;--h-average:#5B6878;--h-font:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;--h-cat-1:#141E2E;--h-cat-2:#1F4FD8;--h-cat-3:#5B6878;--h-cat-4:#7B93E8;--h-cat-5:#9AA6B5;--h-cat-6:#C2CCF5" lang="en"><div class="hero__top"><span class="hero__brand">Hesabu</span><span class="hero__period">September 2026</span></div><h1 class="hero__title">Your September in money</h1><table class="hero__tally"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Rent and housing</th><td>KSh 22,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Groceries</th><td>KSh 18,240</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Family and friends</th><td>KSh 12,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Transport</th><td>KSh 11,460</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Utilities</th><td>KSh 8,199</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eating out</th><td>KSh 7,310</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Everything else</th><td>KSh 15,981</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="hero__total"><span class="hero__total-label">Total spent</span><span class="hero__total-value">KSh 95,190</span></div><p class="hero__delta">KSh 6,250 more than last month</p><ul class="hero__insights"><li>Highest income month since April</li><li>Fuliza cost KSh 234 in the last week</li><li>Health spending rose to KSh 4,200</li></ul><div class="hero__donut"><svg role="img" aria-label="" width="388" height="400" viewBox="0 0 388 400" data-chart="donut" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;font-family:var(--h-font)"><title></title><g><text x="194" y="28" font-size="28" font-weight="500" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Rent and housing 23%</text><line x1="194" x2="194" y1="34" y2="46" stroke="var(--h-ink-soft)" stroke-width="2"></line></g><path d="M105.03 80.8 A134 134 0 0 1 282.97 80.8 L253.09 114.45 A89 89 0 0 0 134.91 114.45 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-1)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M282.97 80.8 A134 134 0 0 1 319.45 228.11 L277.32 212.29 A89 89 0 0 0 253.09 114.45 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-2)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M319.45 228.11 A134 134 0 0 1 248.58 303.38 L230.25 262.28 A89 89 0 0 0 277.32 212.29 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-3)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M248.58 303.38 A134 134 0 0 1 149.7 307.46 L164.57 264.99 A89 89 0 0 0 230.25 262.28 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-4)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M149.7 307.46 A134 134 0 0 1 90.88 266.57 L125.51 237.83 A89 89 0 0 0 164.57 264.99 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-5)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M90.88 266.57 A134 134 0 0 1 62.95 208.95 L106.96 199.56 A89 89 0 0 0 125.51 237.83 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-6)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M62.95 208.95 A134 134 0 0 1 105.03 80.8 L134.91 114.45 A89 89 0 0 0 106.96 199.56 Z" fill="var(--h-other)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="194" y="191.44" font-size="29" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">KSh 95,190</text><g><rect x="0" y="337" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="var(--h-cat-2)"></rect><text x="24" y="355.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Groceries</text><text x="388" y="355.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">19%</text></g><g><rect x="0" y="373" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="var(--h-cat-3)"></rect><text x="24" y="391.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Family and friends</text><text x="388" y="391.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">13%</text></g></svg></div><div class="hero__foot"><span>Monthly report</span>Full report</div></div>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for monthly-sw > email HTML is table-based with cid images and a text twin 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="sw"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light"/><title>Septemba yako kwa pesa: KSh 95,190 zilitumika, KSh 20,000 akiba</title></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F3F5F7;color-scheme:light"><div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:1px;line-height:1;color:#F3F5F7">Kodi 23%, afya juu 133%, ada KSh 1,486. Bili zinazotarajiwa Oktoba.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F3F5F7"><tbody><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 8px"><table role="presentation" width="600" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:8px"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><span style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0;display:inline">Hesabu</span><span style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;display:inline;margin-left:12px">Ripoti ya mwezi</span><span style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;display:inline;float:right">Septemba 2026</span></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><h1 style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Septemba yako kwa pesa</h1></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:16px"><img src="cid:hero" width="552" alt="Jumla ya matumizi KSh 95,190, KSh +6,250 ikilinganishwa na mwezi uliopita. Ulitumia 7% zaidi ya Agosti na bado ukaweka KSh 20,000 M-Shwari." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:8px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Kodi na nyumba</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 22,000</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Mboga na chakula</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 18,240</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Familia na marafiki</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 12,000</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Usafiri</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 11,460</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Umeme na maji</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 8,199</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Kula nje</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 7,310</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Mengine yote</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 15,981</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">Jumla ya matumizi</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding-left:12px;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">KSh 95,190</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:12px"><b style="font-weight:500">KSh 6,250 zaidi ya mwezi uliopita</b></p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:12px">Ulitumia 7% zaidi ya Agosti na bado ukaweka KSh 20,000 M-Shwari.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Zilizoingia</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#1E7F5C;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 104,350</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh +3,150</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Zilizotoka</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 95,190</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh +6,250</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Ada</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#B7791F;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 1,486</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh +366</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Akiba</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#6B7A8F;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 20,000</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Matumizi yamepanda kwa miezi miwili huku mapato yakiongezeka kidogo</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Septemba ilifunga na salio la KSh 7,674, chini ya KSh 11,140 ya Agosti.</p><img src="cid:trend" width="552" alt="Mistari mitatu kwa miezi sita, Aprili hadi Septemba, ya zilizoingia, zilizotoka na salio. Mapato yalipanda kutoka KSh 92,400 hadi KSh 104,350. Matumizi yalipanda kutoka KSh 84,210 hadi KSh 95,190. Salio lilikuwa juu zaidi Agosti, KSh 11,140, na KSh 7,674 Septemba, ambayo imeangaziwa." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Mapato yalizidi matumizi kwa KSh 7,674 baada ya ada</p><img src="cid:in_out" width="552" alt="Miraba miwili inalinganisha Septemba na Agosti. Septemba: KSh 104,350 ziliingia, KSh 95,190 zilitoka, salio KSh 7,674. Agosti: KSh 101,200 ziliingia, KSh 88,940 zilitoka, salio KSh 11,140." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Kodi na mboga zilichukua 23% na 19% ya mwezi</p><img src="cid:waterfall" width="552" alt="Maporomoko kutoka mapato ya KSh 104,350 kupitia kodi KSh 22,000, mboga na chakula KSh 18,240, familia na marafiki KSh 12,000, usafiri KSh 11,460, umeme na maji KSh 8,199, kategoria nyingine na ada KSh 1,486, hadi salio la KSh 7,674." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Kodi ni 23% ya matumizi; afya iliongezeka zaidi ya maradufu</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Afya ilipanda 133% hadi KSh 4,200 baada ya kwenda hospitali. Mengineyo yalipungua KSh -2,709.</p><img src="cid:categories" width="552" alt="Donati ya matumizi ya KSh 95,190 kwa kategoria. Kodi na nyumba KSh 22,000 (23%), mboga na chakula KSh 18,240 (19%), familia na marafiki KSh 12,000 (13%), usafiri KSh 11,460 (12%), umeme na maji KSh 8,199 (9%), kula nje KSh 7,310 (8%), kategoria nne zilizobaki ndizo zinakamilisha." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Pesa zilienda wapi</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><thead><tr><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left">Kategoria</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Zilizotumika</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Sehemu</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Ikilinganishwa na Agosti</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Kodi na nyumba</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;colo