px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Akiba mwaka huu</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#6B7A8F;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 135,000</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Mambo matatu ya kuangalia Oktoba</p><ol style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;padding-left:24px"><li style="margin-top:8px">Kodi ya KSh 22,000 inatarajiwa tarehe 1 Oktoba.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Usafiri na kula nje zote zilipita bajeti; Oktoba inaanza kutoka sifuri.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Jumbe 5 hazikusomeka. Fundisha Hesabu zilikuwa nini.</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:48px;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:16px">Kila nambari imehesabiwa kutoka kwa jumbe zako za pesa. Hakuna makadirio.</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:8px">Akaunti zilizojumuishwa: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Jumbe ambazo Hesabu haikuweza kusoma: 5</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><a href="https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;background-color:#1F4FD8;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px">Ripoti kamili</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"
