ill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">KSh 48,440</text></g><text x="0" y="102" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)">1 Sep</text><text x="229.88" y="102" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)">30 Sep</text></svg></div><p id="balance_kcb-phone-alt" class="h-visually-hidden">Salio la KCB kwa Septemba nzima, likishuka na kodi na malipo ya kadi na kuruka hadi KSh 48,440 tarehe 28 mshahara wa KSh 85,000 ulipoingia.</p><details class="h-chart__data"><summary class="h-chart__toggle">Onyesha nambari</summary><table class="h-ledger h-ledger--compact"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Data ya chati: KCB ilifunga mwezi na KSh 48,440</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Tarehe</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Salio</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">1 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 22,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 18,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 18,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 18,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">11 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 16,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 14,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">13 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 11,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">14 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 11,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">15 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 11,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">16 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 11,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">17 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 11,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">18 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 11,500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">19 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">20 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">21 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">22 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">23 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">24 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">25 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,700</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">26 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 7,760</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">27 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 7,760</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">28 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 48,440</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">29 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 48,440</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">30 Sep</th><td class="h-num">KSh 48,440</td></tr></tbody></table></details></figure></div></section><section class="h-section h-section--table" aria-label="Unapotumia pesa"><h2 class="h-section__title">Unapotumia pesa</h2><div class="h-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Unapotumia pesa"><table class="h-ledger"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Unapotumia pesa</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Wakati</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Zilizotumika</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Malipo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Asubuhi</th><td class="h-num">KSh 21,340</td><td class="h-num">28</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mchana</th><td class="h-num">KSh 38,910</td><td class="h-num">41</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jioni</th><td class="h-num">KSh 29,480</td><td class="h-num">36</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Usiku</th><td class="h-num">KSh 5,460</td><td class="h-num">7</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="h-section h-section--insights" aria-label="Yafaa kujua"><h2 class="h-section__title">Yafaa kujua</h2><ol class="h-insights"><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_m_15"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Mwezi wenye mapato ya juu zaidi tangu Aprili</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Ziliingia KSh 104,350, pamoja na KSh 85,000 kutoka Jambo Logistics Ltd na KSh 14,600 kutoka Kamau Hardware.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_m_06"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Fuliza iligharimu KSh 234 wiki ya mwisho</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Ulichukua KSh 3,900 kwa siku 3 na ukalipa siku ya mshahara. Kuhamisha sehemu ya mshahara mapema kungeepusha gharama hiyo.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_m_07"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Matumizi ya afya yalipanda hadi KSh 4,200</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Ziara ya Aga Khan University Hospital na mara mbili za duka la dawa. Hesabu iliweka hospitali chini ya afya; badilisha ikiwa si sahihi.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_m_09"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Usafiri ulimaliza 115% ya bajeti yake</h3><p class="h-insight__body">KSh 11,460 dhidi ya KSh 10,000. Mafuta Total Energies yalikuwa KSh 5,400 kati yake.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_m_11"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">KSh 67,000 zilihamishwa kati ya akaunti zako</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Hakuna inayohesabiwa kama matumizi. KSh 20,000 zilienda M-Shwari na KSh 7,000 zilitoka taslimu.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_m_14"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Sehemu mpya: Carrefour Two Rivers</h3><p class="h-insight__body">KSh 3,100 kwa ziara mbili, chini ya mboga na chakula.</p></li></ol></section><section class="h-section h-section--list" aria-label="Pesa zingeweza kwenda vipi tofauti"><h2 class="h-section__title">Pesa zingeweza kwenda vipi tofauti</h2><ul class="h-list"><li>Kuhamisha KSh 20,000 M-Shwari siku ya mshahara, kabla ya kodi, kungeweka M-Pesa nje ya Fuliza.</li><li>Kula nje kulikuwa KSh 7,310. Ziara mbili chache za Java House kwa mwezi ni takriban KSh 2,980.</li><li>Usafiri wa KSh 11,460 ulikuwa kategoria ya tatu kwa ukubwa baada ya kodi na mboga.</li></ul></section><section class="h-section h-section--kpis"><dl class="h-kpis"><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="in"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Zilizoingia mwaka huu</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 870,400</span></dd></div><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="out"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Zilizotoka mwaka huu</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 792,150</span></dd></div><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="fee"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Ada mwaka huu</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 10,420</span></dd></div><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="transfer"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Akiba mwaka huu</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 135,000</span></dd></div></dl></section><section class="h-section h-section--watch" aria-label="Mambo matatu ya kuangalia Oktoba"><h2 class="h-section__title">Mambo matatu ya kuangalia Oktoba</h2><ol class="h-watch"><li>Kodi ya KSh 22,000 inatarajiwa tarehe 1 Oktoba.</li><li>Usafiri na kula nje zote zilipita bajeti; Oktoba inaanza kutoka sifuri.</li><li>Jumbe 5 hazikusomeka. Fundisha Hesabu zilikuwa nini.</li></ol></section><footer class="h-footer"><p class="h-footer__note">Kila nambari imehesabiwa kutoka kwa jumbe zako za pesa. Hakuna makadirio.</p><dl class="h-footer__meta"><div><dt>Akaunti zilizojumuishwa</dt><dd>M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari</dd></div><div><dt>Jumbe ambazo Hesabu haikuweza kusoma</dt><dd class="h-num">5</dd></div><div><dt>Ripoti imetengenezwa</dt><dd>2026-10-01</dd></div></dl><p class="h-footer__writer">Imeandikwa bila AI: nambari tu.</p><p class="h-footer__link"><a class="h-button" href="https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture">Fungua kwenye Hesabu</a></p></footer></div></article></main></div>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for weekly-en > email HTML is table-based with cid images and a text twin 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light"/><title>Your week in money: KSh 20,450 spent, 8% up</title></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F3F5F7;color-scheme:light"><div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:1px;line-height:1;color:#F3F5F7">Groceries 30%, Friday KSh 6,350, fees KSh 312. Three things to watch.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#F3F5F7"><tbody><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 8px"><table role="presentation" width="600" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:8px"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><span style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0;display:inline">Hesabu</span><span style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;display:inline;margin-left:12px">Weekly report</span><span style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;display:inline;float:right">5 to 11 October 2026</span></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><h1 style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Your week in money</h1></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:16px"><img src="cid:hero" width="552" alt="Total spent KSh 20,450, KSh +1,550 vs last week. You spent 8% more than last week, mostly on groceries and money sent home." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:8px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Monday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 2,840</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Tuesday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 1,560</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Wednesday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 4,210</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Thursday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 980</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Friday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 6,350</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Saturday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 3,120</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Sunday</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 1,390</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">Total spent</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding-left:12px;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">KSh 20,450</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:12px"><b style="font-weight:500">KSh 1,550 more than last week</b></p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:12px">You spent 8% more than last week, mostly on groceries and money sent home.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Money in</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#1E7F5C;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 11,700</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh -26,300</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Money out</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 20,450</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh +1,550</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Fees</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#B7791F;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 312</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh +47</p></td><td valign="top" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;width:25%;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0">Net</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh -9,062</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Money in fell after last week’s salary; spending held steady</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 11,700 came in against KSh 20,450 out, so the week closed at KSh -9,062.</p><img src="cid:in_out" width="552" alt="Two bars compare this week and last. This week: KSh 11,700 in, KSh 20,450 out, net KSh -9,062. Last week: KSh 38,000 in, KSh 18,900 out, net KSh 18,835." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Groceries took 30% of the week</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Family and friends doubled to KSh 4,000 after you sent money home on Friday.</p><img src="cid:categories" width="552" alt="Donut of KSh 20,450 spending by category. Groceries KSh 6,120 (30%), family and friends KSh 4,000 (20%), transport KSh 3,480 (17%), utilities KSh 3,200 (16%), eating out KSh 1,450, airtime and data KSh 1,150, other KSh 1,050." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Friday was the spendiest day at KSh 6,350</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">The daily average was KSh 2,921. Thursday was the quietest day at KSh 980.</p><img src="cid:daily" width="552" alt="Seven bars, one per day, against an average line at KSh 2,921. Monday KSh 2,840, Tuesday KSh 1,560, Wednesday KSh 4,210, Thursday KSh 980, Friday KSh 6,350, Saturday KSh 3,120, Sunday KSh 1,390." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Where it went</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><thead><tr><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left">Category</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Spent</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Share</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">vs last week</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Groceries</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 6,120</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">30%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh +640</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Family and friends</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 4,000</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">20%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh +2,000</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Transport</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 3,480</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">17%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh -420</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Utilities</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 3,200</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">16%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh +1,200</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Eating out</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 1,450</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">7%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh -860</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Airtime and data</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 1,150</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">6%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh -160</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Other</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 1,050</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">5%</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh -850</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">Total</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding-left:12px;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">KSh 20,450</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding-left:12px;border-top:1px solid #141E2E"></td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding-left:12px;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">KSh +1,550</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Naivas was the biggest merchant at KSh 3,860</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Two new places this week: Quickmart Kangemi and Kibandaski Kangemi.</p><img src="cid:merchants" width="552" alt="Horizontal bars for the top eight merchants. Naivas Westlands KSh 3,860, KPLC prepaid KSh 2,000, Total Energies Parklands KSh 1,800, Matatu and boda (cash) KSh 1,680, Mama Mboga Kangemi KSh 1,260, Nairobi Water KSh 1,200, Safaricom KSh 1,150, Quickmart Kangemi KSh 1,000 (new)." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">People</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><thead><tr><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left">Person</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Sent</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Received</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Mum</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 4,000</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 0</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Jane Wanjiru</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 0</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 3,500</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Fees took 2% of what you spent</p><img src="cid:fees" width="552" alt="A short ruled bar: fees of KSh 312 are 2% of KSh 20,450 spent." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;background-color:#F3F5F7;border-left:3px solid #B7791F"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0">KSh 312 went on fees this week, KSh 87 of it Fuliza charges for 2 days in overdraft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Moved, not spent</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse"><thead><tr><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left">Movement</th><th style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#5B6878;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right">Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">To M-Shwari</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 5,000</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Cash withdrawn</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 2,000</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:400;padding-left:0">Fuliza repaid</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2DC;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:400;padding-left:12px">KSh 1,200</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:left;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">Total moved</td><td style="padding:8px 0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;border-bottom:3px double #141E2E;font-size:14px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;padding-left:12px;border-top:1px solid #141E2E">KSh 7,000</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Transport is on course to pass its budget</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">At this pace transport ends October at KSh 12,860 against a KSh 12,000 limit.</p><img src="cid:budgets" width="552" alt="Three budget bars for October so far. Groceries KSh 9,840 of KSh 25,000, projected KSh 25,420. Transport KSh 4,980 of KSh 12,000, projected KSh 12,860. Eating out KSh 1,450 of KSh 5,000, projected KSh 3,750." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Worth knowing</p><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Two Safaricom payments a minute apart</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Two bundle purchases of the same amount landed one minute apart on Thursday. If one was a mistake, Safaricom can reverse it.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Fuliza cost you KSh 87</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">You drew KSh 1,500 on Fuliza and repaid KSh 1,200. Two days in overdraft cost KSh 87.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">KSh 4,000 sent to Mum</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Money sent to family and friends doubled compared with last week. It is counted as spending, not a transfer.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">A new place: Quickmart Kangemi</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">First time Hesabu has seen Quickmart Kangemi. KSh 1,000 over two visits, filed under groceries.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">KSh 2,000 withdrawn as cash</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Cash is shown as a transfer. Matatu and boda fares you add by hand show up under transport.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">You saved 43% of what came in</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 5,000 went to M-Shwari from KSh 11,700 received. Savings are kept out of spending.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">M-Pesa ended the week at KSh 4,318</p><img src="cid:balance_mpesa" width="552" alt="M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Three things to watch next week</p><ol style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;padding-left:24px"><li style="margin-top:8px">Safaricom Home Fibre is due on 15 October, usually KSh 2,999.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Transport is projected to reach KSh 12,860, past its KSh 12,000 budget.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Your M-Pesa balance is KSh 4,318. Fuliza kicks in again if it runs out before Friday.</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;background-color:#F3F5F7;border-left:3px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0">3 messages could not be read. Open Hesabu to teach it what they were.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:48px;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:16px">Every number is computed from your money messages. Nothing is estimated.</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:8px">Accounts covered: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Messages Hesabu could not read: 3</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><a href="https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;background-color:#1F4FD8;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px">Full report</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for weekly-en > email HTML is table-based with cid images and a text twin 2`] = `
"Hesabu, Weekly report, 5 to 11 October 2026

Your week in money
------------------

Monday                           KSh 2,840
Tuesday                          KSh 1,560
Wednesday                        KSh 4,210
Thursday                           KSh 980
Friday                           KSh 6,350
Saturday                         KSh 3,120
Sunday                           KSh 1,390
Total spent                     KSh 20,450
KSh 1,550 more than last week

You spent 8% more than last week, mostly on groceries and money sent home.

Money in: KSh 11,700 (KSh -26,300)
Money out: KSh 20,450 (KSh +1,550)
Fees: KSh 312 (KSh +47)
Net: KSh -9,062

Money in fell after last week’s salary; spending held steady
Two bars compare this week and last. This week: KSh 11,700 in, KSh 20,450 out, net KSh -9,062. Last week: KSh 38,000 in, KSh 18,900 out, net KSh 18,835.

Groceries took 30% of the week
Donut of KSh 20,450 spending by category. Groceries KSh 6,120 (30%), family and friends KSh 4,000 (20%), transport KSh 3,480 (17%), utilities KSh 3,200 (16%), eating out KSh 1,450, airtime and data KSh 1,150, other KSh 1,050.

Friday was the spendiest day at KSh 6,350
Seven bars, one per day, against an average line at KSh 2,921. Monday KSh 2,840, Tuesday KSh 1,560, Wednesday KSh 4,210, Thursday KSh 980, Friday KSh 6,350, Saturday KSh 3,120, Sunday KSh 1,390.

Where it went
-------------
Groceries  |  KSh 6,120  |  30%  |  KSh +640
Family and friends  |  KSh 4,000  |  20%  |  KSh +2,000
Transport  |  KSh 3,480  |  17%  |  KSh -420
Utilities  |  KSh 3,200  |  16%  |  KSh +1,200
Eating out  |  KSh 1,450  |  7%  |  KSh -860
Airtime and data  |  KSh 1,150  |  6%  |  KSh -160
Other  |  KSh 1,050  |  5%  |  KSh -850
Total  |  KSh 20,450  |    |  KSh +1,550

Naivas was the biggest merchant at KSh 3,860
Horizontal bars for the top eight merchants. Naivas Westlands KSh 3,860, KPLC prepaid KSh 2,000, Total Energies Parklands KSh 1,800, Matatu and boda (cash) KSh 1,680, Mama Mboga Kangemi KSh 1,260, Nairobi Water KSh 1,200, Safaricom KSh 1,150, Quickmart Kangemi KSh 1,000 (new).

People
------
Mum  |  KSh 4,000  |  KSh 0
Jane Wanjiru  |  KSh 0  |  KSh 3,500

Fees took 2% of what you spent
A short ruled bar: fees of KSh 312 are 2% of KSh 20,450 spent.

> KSh 312 went on fees this week, KSh 87 of it Fuliza charges for 2 days in overdraft.

Moved, not spent
----------------
To M-Shwari  |  KSh 5,000
Cash withdrawn  |  KSh 2,000
Fuliza repaid  |  KSh 1,200
Total moved  |  KSh 7,000

Transport is on course to pass its budget
Three budget bars for October so far. Groceries KSh 9,840 of KSh 25,000, projected KSh 25,420. Transport KSh 4,980 of KSh 12,000, projected KSh 12,860. Eating out KSh 1,450 of KSh 5,000, projected KSh 3,750.

Worth knowing
-------------
- Two Safaricom payments a minute apart
  Two bundle purchases of the same amount landed one minute apart on Thursday. If one was a mistake, Safaricom can reverse it.
- Fuliza cost you KSh 87
  You drew KSh 1,500 on Fuliza and repaid KSh 1,200. Two days in overdraft cost KSh 87.
- KSh 4,000 sent to Mum
  Money sent to family and friends doubled compared with last week. It is counted as spending, not a transfer.
- A new place: Quickmart Kangemi
  First time Hesabu has seen Quickmart Kangemi. KSh 1,000 over two visits, filed under groceries.
- KSh 2,000 withdrawn as cash
  Cash is shown as a transfer. Matatu and boda fares you add by hand show up under transport.
- You saved 43% of what came in
  KSh 5,000 went to M-Shwari from KSh 11,700 received. Savings are kept out of spending.

M-Pesa ended the week at KSh 4,318
M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday.

Three things to watch next week
-------------------------------
1. Safaricom Home Fibre is due on 15 October, usually KSh 2,999.
2. Transport is projected to reach KSh 12,860, past its KSh 12,000 budget.
3. Your M-Pesa balance is KSh 4,318. Fuliza kicks in again if it runs out before Friday.

> 3 messages could not be read. Open Hesabu to teach it what they were.

Every number is computed from your money messages. Nothing is estimated.
Accounts covered: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari
Messages Hesabu could not read: 3

Full report: https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for weekly-en > hero HTML carries the tally, three insight lines and the donut 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Your week in money</title>
<style>
@font-face {…}
@font-face {…}
:root, [data-theme="light"] {
  --h-paper: #F3F5F7;
  --h-sheet: #FFFFFF;
  --h-rule: #C9D2DC;
  --h-ink: #141E2E;
  --h-ink-soft: #5B6878;
  --h-biro: #1F4FD8;
  --h-on-biro: #FFFFFF;
  --h-in: #1E7F5C;
  --h-out: #141E2E;
  --h-fee: #B7791F;
  --h-transfer: #6B7A8F;
  --h-warn: #A23B2A;
  --h-other: #DCE2E9;
  --h-average: #5B6878;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #141E2E;
  --h-cat-2: #1F4FD8;
  --h-cat-3: #5B6878;
  --h-cat-4: #7B93E8;
  --h-cat-5: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-6: #C2CCF5;
  color-scheme: light;
}
[data-theme="dark"] {
  --h-paper: #101722;
  --h-sheet: #17202D;
  --h-rule: #2A3443;
  --h-ink: #E8ECF1;
  --h-ink-soft: #9AA6B5;
  --h-biro: #6D8DFF;
  --h-on-biro: #0B1220;
  --h-in: #4FC08D;
  --h-out: #E8ECF1;
  --h-fee: #E0A43C;
  --h-transfer: #8A98AC;
  --h-warn: #E0705C;
  --h-other: #2F3A4A;
  --h-average: #9AA6B5;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #E8ECF1;
  --h-cat-2: #6D8DFF;
  --h-cat-3: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-4: #A9BBFF;
  --h-cat-5: #6F7C8E;
  --h-cat-6: #4A5CA8;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
  --h-paper: #101722;
  --h-sheet: #17202D;
  --h-rule: #2A3443;
  --h-ink: #E8ECF1;
  --h-ink-soft: #9AA6B5;
  --h-biro: #6D8DFF;
  --h-on-biro: #0B1220;
  --h-in: #4FC08D;
  --h-out: #E8ECF1;
  --h-fee: #E0A43C;
  --h-transfer: #8A98AC;
  --h-warn: #E0705C;
  --h-other: #2F3A4A;
  --h-average: #9AA6B5;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #E8ECF1;
  --h-cat-2: #6D8DFF;
  --h-cat-3: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-4: #A9BBFF;
  --h-cat-5: #6F7C8E;
  --h-cat-6: #4A5CA8;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}

html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body { font-family: var(--h-font); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; background: var(--h-paper); color: var(--h-ink); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
.h-page { min-height: 100vh; background: var(--h-paper); color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-page--report { padding: 0; }
@media (min-width: 720px) { .h-page--report { padding: 32px 16px; } }


.h-chart { margin: 0; max-width: 100%; }
.h-chart__caption { display: block; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.h-chart__title { display: block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-chart__takeaway { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-chart__plot { overflow: visible; }
.h-chart__plot svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.h-chart__data { margin-top: 8px; }
.h-chart__toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-biro); list-style: none; }
.h-chart__toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.h-chart__toggle::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-right: 8px; border-right: 2px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; transform: rotate(-45deg); transition: transform 180ms; }
.h-chart__data[open] > .h-chart__toggle::before { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.h-chart__toggle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.h-ledger { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger th, .h-ledger td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); text-align: left; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; }
.h-ledger th { color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-ledger thead th { font-size: 14px; }
.h-ledger tbody th { color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger .h-num { text-align: right; }
.h-ledger td.h-num { white-space: nowrap; }
.h-ledger td + td, .h-ledger th + th, .h-ledger th + td { padding-left: 12px; }
.h-ledger .h-total th, .h-ledger .h-total td { font-weight: 700; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-ink); border-bottom: 3px double var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger--compact { font-size: 14px; }
.h-ledger--compact th, .h-ledger--compact td { padding: 8px 0; }
.h-visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .h-chart__toggle::before { transition: none; } }
@media print { .h-chart__data { display: none; } }


.h-report { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 24px 48px; background: var(--h-sheet); color: var(--h-ink); font-family: var(--h-font); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; border-radius: 8px; }
.h-report a { color: var(--h-biro); }
.h-report :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; }
.h-num { text-align: right; }
/* Figures stay proportional: this font's tnum also widens the comma, which reads as "2 , 840". Alignment comes from the right edge. */
.h-masthead { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; align-items: baseline; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-masthead__brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-masthead__period { margin-left: auto; }
.h-report__title { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.h-hero { margin-top: 24px; }
.h-tally { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
.h-tally__row th, .h-tally__row td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; }
.h-tally__row td.h-num, .h-tally__total td.h-num { text-align: right; }
.h-tally__row td { font-size: 16px; }
.h-tally__label { color: var(--h-ink-soft); font-size: 14px; }
.h-tally__total th, .h-tally__total td { padding: 16px 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-ink); vertical-align: baseline; }
.h-tally__label--total { color: var(--h-ink); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; }
.h-tally__value--total { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.h-tally__rule { height: 0; border-bottom: 3px double var(--h-ink); }
.h-hero__delta { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; }
.h-hero__verdict { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 36em; }
.h-sections { margin-top: 32px; }
.h-table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
.h-table-scroll:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.h-ledger th.h-num { white-space: normal; }
.h-section { margin-top: 32px; }
.h-section__title { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; }
.h-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0 24px; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-rule); }
.h-kpi { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); min-width: 0; }
.h-kpi__label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-kpi__value { margin: 4px 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 8px; }
.h-kpi__amount { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: nowrap; }
.h-kpi[data-tone="in"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-in); }
.h-kpi[data-tone="fee"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-fee); }
.h-kpi[data-tone="transfer"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-transfer); }
.h-kpi__delta { font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-chart-size--phone { display: none; }
.h-insights, .h-watch, .h-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.h-insights { list-style: none; }
.h-insight { margin-top: 16px; }
.h-insight:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.h-insight__headline { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; }
.h-insight__body { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 16px; max-width: 40em; }
.h-list { padding-left: 1.2em; }
.h-list li, .h-watch li { margin-top: 8px; max-width: 40em; }
.h-watch { list-style: none; counter-reset: watch; }
.h-watch li { position: relative; padding-left: 32px; counter-increment: watch; }
.h-watch li::before { content: counter(watch); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--h-biro); color: var(--h-on-biro); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; }
.h-callout { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid var(--h-rule); background: var(--h-paper); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
.h-callout p { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; }
.h-callout--fee { border-left-color: var(--h-fee); }
.h-callout--warn { border-left-color: var(--h-warn); }
.h-footer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-footer__note { margin: 0; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-footer__meta { margin: 12px 0 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.h-footer__meta dt { display: inline; }
.h-footer__meta dt::after { content: ": "; }
.h-footer__meta dd { display: inline; margin: 0; color: var(--h-ink); text-align: left; }
.h-footer__writer { margin: 12px 0 0; }
.h-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--h-biro); color: var(--h-on-biro); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
.h-report a.h-button { color: var(--h-on-biro); }
.h-report--monthly .h-tally__row td { font-size: 16px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) {
  .h-report { padding: 32px 24px 48px; }
  .h-report__title { font-size: 40px; }
  .h-tally__value--total { font-size: 56px; }
  .h-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 719px) {
  .h-report { padding: 16px 16px 32px; border-radius: 0; }
  .h-chart-size--web { display: none; }
  .h-chart-size--phone { display: block; }
}
@keyframes h-row-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
@keyframes h-rule-in { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .h-report--web .h-tally__row, .h-report--web .h-tally__total { animation: h-row-in 300ms both; animation-delay: calc(var(--i, 0) * 30ms); }
  .h-report--web .h-tally__rule { transform-origin: left; animation: h-rule-in 300ms both; animation-delay: calc(var(--rows, 7) * 30ms + 200ms); }
}
@media print {
  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 14mm 16mm; }
  html, body { background: #fff !important; }
  .h-report { max-width: none; padding: 0; border-radius: 0; background: #fff; color: #141E2E; }
  .h-chart-size--phone, .h-chart__data, .h-footer__link, .h-skip { display: none !important; }
  .h-chart-size--web { display: block !important; }
  .h-section, .h-callout, .h-kpis, .h-hero { break-inside: avoid; }
  .h-section__title { break-after: avoid; }
  .h-kpi__amount { font-size: 24px; }
  .h-kpis { gap: 0 16px; }
  .h-tally__row, .h-tally__total, .h-tally__rule { animation: none !important; }
}


.hero { position: relative; width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 72px; background: var(--h-sheet); color: var(--h-ink); font-family: var(--h-font); overflow: hidden; }
.hero__top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
.hero__brand { font-size: 44px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.hero__period { font-size: 30px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.hero__title { margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
.hero__tally { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 32px; }
.hero__tally th, .hero__tally td { padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; text-align: left; }
.hero__tally th { color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.hero__tally td { text-align: right; }
.hero__total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding: 28px 0 20px; border-bottom: 6px double var(--h-ink); }
.hero__total-label { font-size: 30px; }
.hero__total-value { font-size: 104px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.hero__delta { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 32px; width: 520px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 500; }
.hero__insights { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; width: 520px; }
.hero__insights li { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 28px; position: relative; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; overflow: hidden; }
.hero__insights li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--h-biro); }
.hero__donut { position: absolute; right: 72px; bottom: 130px; width: 388px; }
.hero__donut svg { display: block; width: 388px; height: auto; }
.hero__foot { position: absolute; left: 72px; right: 72px; bottom: 72px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-size: 30px; color: var(--h-biro); font-weight: 500; }
.hero__foot span { color: var(--h-ink-soft); font-weight: 400; }

body { background: var(--h-sheet); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero" style="--h-paper:#F3F5F7;--h-sheet:#FFFFFF;--h-rule:#C9D2DC;--h-ink:#141E2E;--h-ink-soft:#5B6878;--h-biro:#1F4FD8;--h-on-biro:#FFFFFF;--h-in:#1E7F5C;--h-out:#141E2E;--h-fee:#B7791F;--h-transfer:#6B7A8F;--h-warn:#A23B2A;--h-other:#DCE2E9;--h-average:#5B6878;--h-font:&quot;Schibsted Grotesk&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;--h-cat-1:#141E2E;--h-cat-2:#1F4FD8;--h-cat-3:#5B6878;--h-cat-4:#7B93E8;--h-cat-5:#9AA6B5;--h-cat-6:#C2CCF5" lang="en"><div class="hero__top"><span class="hero__brand">Hesabu</span><span class="hero__period">5 to 11 October 2026</span></div><h1 class="hero__title">Your week in money</h1><table class="hero__tally"><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Monday</th><td>KSh 2,840</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tuesday</th><td>KSh 1,560</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wednesday</th><td>KSh 4,210</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Thursday</th><td>KSh 980</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Friday</th><td>KSh 6,350</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Saturday</th><td>KSh 3,120</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunday</th><td>KSh 1,390</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="hero__total"><span class="hero__total-label">Total spent</span><span class="hero__total-value">KSh 20,450</span></div><p class="hero__delta">KSh 1,550 more than last week</p><ul class="hero__insights"><li>Two Safaricom payments a minute apart</li><li>Fuliza cost you KSh 87</li><li>KSh 4,000 sent to Mum</li></ul><div class="hero__donut"><svg role="img" aria-label="" width="388" height="400" viewBox="0 0 388 400" data-chart="donut" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;font-family:var(--h-font)"><title></title><g><text x="194" y="28" font-size="28" font-weight="500" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Groceries 30%</text><line x1="194" x2="194" y1="34" y2="46" stroke="var(--h-ink-soft)" stroke-width="2"></line></g><path d="M85.77 101.99 A134 134 0 0 1 302.23 101.99 L265.88 128.52 A89 89 0 0 0 122.12 128.52 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-1)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M302.23 101.99 A134 134 0 0 1 304.72 256.48 L267.54 231.13 A89 89 0 0 0 265.88 128.52 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-2)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M304.72 256.48 A134 134 0 0 1 181.05 314.37 L185.4 269.58 A89 89 0 0 0 267.54 231.13 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-3)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M181.05 314.37 A134 134 0 0 1 75.82 244.16 L115.51 222.95 A89 89 0 0 0 185.4 269.58 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-4)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M75.82 244.16 A134 134 0 0 1 60.14 187.07 L105.09 185.03 A89 89 0 0 0 115.51 222.95 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-5)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M60.14 187.07 A134 134 0 0 1 66.31 140.38 L109.19 154.02 A89 89 0 0 0 105.09 185.03 Z" fill="var(--h-cat-6)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M66.31 140.38 A134 134 0 0 1 85.77 101.99 L122.12 128.52 A89 89 0 0 0 109.19 154.02 Z" fill="var(--h-other)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><text x="194" y="191.44" font-size="29" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">KSh 20,450</text><g><rect x="0" y="337" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="var(--h-cat-2)"></rect><text x="24" y="355.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Family and friends</text><text x="388" y="355.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">20%</text></g><g><rect x="0" y="373" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="var(--h-cat-3)"></rect><text x="24" y="391.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Transport</text><text x="388" y="391.8" font-size="28" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">17%</text></g></svg></div><div class="hero__foot"><span>Weekly report</span>Full report</div></div>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for weekly-en > web HTML is standalone, themed and deterministic 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Your week in money, 5 to 11 October 2026</title>
<meta name="description" content="Groceries 30%, Friday KSh 6,350, fees KSh 312. Three things to watch.">
<style>
@font-face {…}
@font-face {…}
:root, [data-theme="light"] {
  --h-paper: #F3F5F7;
  --h-sheet: #FFFFFF;
  --h-rule: #C9D2DC;
  --h-ink: #141E2E;
  --h-ink-soft: #5B6878;
  --h-biro: #1F4FD8;
  --h-on-biro: #FFFFFF;
  --h-in: #1E7F5C;
  --h-out: #141E2E;
  --h-fee: #B7791F;
  --h-transfer: #6B7A8F;
  --h-warn: #A23B2A;
  --h-other: #DCE2E9;
  --h-average: #5B6878;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #141E2E;
  --h-cat-2: #1F4FD8;
  --h-cat-3: #5B6878;
  --h-cat-4: #7B93E8;
  --h-cat-5: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-6: #C2CCF5;
  color-scheme: light;
}
[data-theme="dark"] {
  --h-paper: #101722;
  --h-sheet: #17202D;
  --h-rule: #2A3443;
  --h-ink: #E8ECF1;
  --h-ink-soft: #9AA6B5;
  --h-biro: #6D8DFF;
  --h-on-biro: #0B1220;
  --h-in: #4FC08D;
  --h-out: #E8ECF1;
  --h-fee: #E0A43C;
  --h-transfer: #8A98AC;
  --h-warn: #E0705C;
  --h-other: #2F3A4A;
  --h-average: #9AA6B5;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #E8ECF1;
  --h-cat-2: #6D8DFF;
  --h-cat-3: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-4: #A9BBFF;
  --h-cat-5: #6F7C8E;
  --h-cat-6: #4A5CA8;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
  --h-paper: #101722;
  --h-sheet: #17202D;
  --h-rule: #2A3443;
  --h-ink: #E8ECF1;
  --h-ink-soft: #9AA6B5;
  --h-biro: #6D8DFF;
  --h-on-biro: #0B1220;
  --h-in: #4FC08D;
  --h-out: #E8ECF1;
  --h-fee: #E0A43C;
  --h-transfer: #8A98AC;
  --h-warn: #E0705C;
  --h-other: #2F3A4A;
  --h-average: #9AA6B5;
  --h-font: "Schibsted Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;
  --h-cat-1: #E8ECF1;
  --h-cat-2: #6D8DFF;
  --h-cat-3: #9AA6B5;
  --h-cat-4: #A9BBFF;
  --h-cat-5: #6F7C8E;
  --h-cat-6: #4A5CA8;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
}

html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body { font-family: var(--h-font); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; background: var(--h-paper); color: var(--h-ink); -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
.h-page { min-height: 100vh; background: var(--h-paper); color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-page--report { padding: 0; }
@media (min-width: 720px) { .h-page--report { padding: 32px 16px; } }


.h-chart { margin: 0; max-width: 100%; }
.h-chart__caption { display: block; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.h-chart__title { display: block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-chart__takeaway { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-chart__plot { overflow: visible; }
.h-chart__plot svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.h-chart__data { margin-top: 8px; }
.h-chart__toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-biro); list-style: none; }
.h-chart__toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.h-chart__toggle::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; margin-right: 8px; border-right: 2px solid currentColor; border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor; transform: rotate(-45deg); transition: transform 180ms; }
.h-chart__data[open] > .h-chart__toggle::before { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.h-chart__toggle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.h-ledger { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger th, .h-ledger td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); text-align: left; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; }
.h-ledger th { color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-ledger thead th { font-size: 14px; }
.h-ledger tbody th { color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger .h-num { text-align: right; }
.h-ledger td.h-num { white-space: nowrap; }
.h-ledger td + td, .h-ledger th + th, .h-ledger th + td { padding-left: 12px; }
.h-ledger .h-total th, .h-ledger .h-total td { font-weight: 700; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-ink); border-bottom: 3px double var(--h-ink); }
.h-ledger--compact { font-size: 14px; }
.h-ledger--compact th, .h-ledger--compact td { padding: 8px 0; }
.h-visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .h-chart__toggle::before { transition: none; } }
@media print { .h-chart__data { display: none; } }


.h-report { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 24px 48px; background: var(--h-sheet); color: var(--h-ink); font-family: var(--h-font); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; border-radius: 8px; }
.h-report a { color: var(--h-biro); }
.h-report :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; }
.h-num { text-align: right; }
/* Figures stay proportional: this font's tnum also widens the comma, which reads as "2 , 840". Alignment comes from the right edge. */
.h-masthead { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; align-items: baseline; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-masthead__brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-masthead__period { margin-left: auto; }
.h-report__title { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.h-hero { margin-top: 24px; }
.h-tally { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
.h-tally__row th, .h-tally__row td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-weight: 400; text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; }
.h-tally__row td.h-num, .h-tally__total td.h-num { text-align: right; }
.h-tally__row td { font-size: 16px; }
.h-tally__label { color: var(--h-ink-soft); font-size: 14px; }
.h-tally__total th, .h-tally__total td { padding: 16px 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-ink); vertical-align: baseline; }
.h-tally__label--total { color: var(--h-ink); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; }
.h-tally__value--total { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.h-tally__rule { height: 0; border-bottom: 3px double var(--h-ink); }
.h-hero__delta { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; }
.h-hero__verdict { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 36em; }
.h-sections { margin-top: 32px; }
.h-table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
.h-table-scroll:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--h-biro); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.h-ledger th.h-num { white-space: normal; }
.h-section { margin-top: 32px; }
.h-section__title { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; }
.h-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0 24px; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-rule); }
.h-kpi { padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--h-rule); min-width: 0; }
.h-kpi__label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-kpi__value { margin: 4px 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 8px; }
.h-kpi__amount { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: nowrap; }
.h-kpi[data-tone="in"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-in); }
.h-kpi[data-tone="fee"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-fee); }
.h-kpi[data-tone="transfer"] .h-kpi__amount { color: var(--h-transfer); }
.h-kpi__delta { font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-chart-size--phone { display: none; }
.h-insights, .h-watch, .h-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.h-insights { list-style: none; }
.h-insight { margin-top: 16px; }
.h-insight:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.h-insight__headline { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; }
.h-insight__body { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 16px; max-width: 40em; }
.h-list { padding-left: 1.2em; }
.h-list li, .h-watch li { margin-top: 8px; max-width: 40em; }
.h-watch { list-style: none; counter-reset: watch; }
.h-watch li { position: relative; padding-left: 32px; counter-increment: watch; }
.h-watch li::before { content: counter(watch); position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--h-biro); color: var(--h-on-biro); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 24px; text-align: center; }
.h-callout { margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 3px solid var(--h-rule); background: var(--h-paper); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
.h-callout p { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; }
.h-callout--fee { border-left-color: var(--h-fee); }
.h-callout--warn { border-left-color: var(--h-warn); }
.h-footer { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--h-rule); font-size: 14px; color: var(--h-ink-soft); }
.h-footer__note { margin: 0; color: var(--h-ink); }
.h-footer__meta { margin: 12px 0 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.h-footer__meta dt { display: inline; }
.h-footer__meta dt::after { content: ": "; }
.h-footer__meta dd { display: inline; margin: 0; color: var(--h-ink); text-align: left; }
.h-footer__writer { margin: 12px 0 0; }
.h-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--h-biro); color: var(--h-on-biro); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
.h-report a.h-button { color: var(--h-on-biro); }
.h-report--monthly .h-tally__row td { font-size: 16px; }
@media (min-width: 720px) {
  .h-report { padding: 32px 24px 48px; }
  .h-report__title { font-size: 40px; }
  .h-tally__value--total { font-size: 56px; }
  .h-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 719px) {
  .h-report { padding: 16px 16px 32px; border-radius: 0; }
  .h-chart-size--web { display: none; }
  .h-chart-size--phone { display: block; }
}
@keyframes h-row-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
@keyframes h-rule-in { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
  .h-report--web .h-tally__row, .h-report--web .h-tally__total { animation: h-row-in 300ms both; animation-delay: calc(var(--i, 0) * 30ms); }
  .h-report--web .h-tally__rule { transform-origin: left; animation: h-rule-in 300ms both; animation-delay: calc(var(--rows, 7) * 30ms + 200ms); }
}
@media print {
  @page { size: A4; margin: 14mm 14mm 16mm; }
  html, body { background: #fff !important; }
  .h-report { max-width: none; padding: 0; border-radius: 0; background: #fff; color: #141E2E; }
  .h-chart-size--phone, .h-chart__data, .h-footer__link, .h-skip { display: none !important; }
  .h-chart-size--web { display: block !important; }
  .h-section, .h-callout, .h-kpis, .h-hero { break-inside: avoid; }
  .h-section__title { break-after: avoid; }
  .h-kpi__amount { font-size: 24px; }
  .h-kpis { gap: 0 16px; }
  .h-tally__row, .h-tally__total, .h-tally__rule { animation: none !important; }
}


</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="h-page h-page--report"><main id="report"><article class="h-report h-report--weekly h-report--web" lang="en" data-report-id="rpt_w_2026-10-05_en"><header class="h-masthead"><span class="h-masthead__brand">Hesabu</span><span class="h-masthead__kind">Weekly report</span><span class="h-masthead__period">5 to 11 October 2026</span></header><h1 class="h-report__title">Your week in money</h1><section class="h-hero" aria-labelledby="h-hero-total"><table class="h-tally" style="--rows:7"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Total spent</caption><tbody><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:0"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Monday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 2,840</td></tr><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:1"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Tuesday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 1,560</td></tr><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:2"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Wednesday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 4,210</td></tr><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:3"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Thursday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 980</td></tr><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:4"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Friday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 6,350</td></tr><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:5"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Saturday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 3,120</td></tr><tr class="h-tally__row" style="--i:6"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label">Sunday</th><td class="h-tally__value h-num">KSh 1,390</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr class="h-tally__total" style="--i:7"><th scope="row" class="h-tally__label h-tally__label--total">Total spent</th><td class="h-tally__value h-tally__value--total h-num" id="h-hero-total">KSh 20,450</td></tr></tfoot></table><div class="h-tally__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="h-hero__delta" data-direction="up">KSh 1,550 more than last week</p><p class="h-hero__verdict">You spent 8% more than last week, mostly on groceries and money sent home.</p></section><div class="h-sections"><section class="h-section h-section--kpis"><dl class="h-kpis"><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="in"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Money in</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 11,700</span><span class="h-kpi__delta h-num">KSh -26,300</span></dd></div><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="out"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Money out</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 20,450</span><span class="h-kpi__delta h-num">KSh +1,550</span></dd></div><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="fee"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Fees</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh 312</span><span class="h-kpi__delta h-num">KSh +47</span></dd></div><div class="h-kpi" data-tone="neutral"><dt class="h-kpi__label">Net</dt><dd class="h-kpi__value"><span class="h-kpi__amount">KSh -9,062</span></dd></div></dl></section><section class="h-section h-section--chart" id="chart-in_out"><div class="h-chart-size h-chart-size--web"><figure class="h-chart" data-chart-id="in_out" style="max-width:672px;margin:0" aria-labelledby="in_out-title" aria-describedby="in_out-alt"><figcaption class="h-chart__caption"><span id="in_out-title" class="h-chart__title">Money in fell after last week’s salary; spending held steady</span><span class="h-chart__takeaway">KSh 11,700 came in against KSh 20,450 out, so the week closed at KSh -9,062.</span></figcaption><div class="h-chart__plot"><svg role="img" aria-label="Two bars compare this week and last. This week: KSh 11,700 in, KSh 20,450 out, net KSh -9,062. Last week: KSh 38,000 in, KSh 18,900 out, net KSh 18,835." width="672" height="232" viewBox="0 0 672 232" data-chart="stacked_in_out" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;font-family:var(--h-font)"><title>Two bars compare this week and last. This week: KSh 11,700 in, KSh 20,450 out, net KSh -9,062. Last week: KSh 38,000 in, KSh 18,900 out, net KSh 18,835.</title><g><line x1="34" x2="664" y1="188" y2="188" stroke="var(-