/td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fees of spending</th><td class="h-num">2%</td></tr></tbody></table></details></figure></div></section><aside class="h-callout h-callout--fee" role="note"><p>KSh 312 went on fees this week, KSh 87 of it Fuliza charges for 2 days in overdraft.</p></aside><section class="h-section h-section--table" aria-label="Moved, not spent"><h2 class="h-section__title">Moved, not spent</h2><div class="h-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="Moved, not spent"><table class="h-ledger"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Moved, not spent</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Movement</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">To M-Shwari</th><td class="h-num">KSh 5,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cash withdrawn</th><td class="h-num">KSh 2,000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fuliza repaid</th><td class="h-num">KSh 1,200</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr class="h-total"><th scope="row">Total moved</th><td class="h-num">KSh 7,000</td></tr></tfoot></table></div></section><section class="h-section h-section--chart" id="chart-budgets"><div class="h-chart-size h-chart-size--web"><figure class="h-chart" data-chart-id="budgets" style="max-width:672px;margin:0" aria-labelledby="budgets-title" aria-describedby="budgets-alt"><figcaption class="h-chart__caption"><span id="budgets-title" class="h-chart__title">Transport is on course to pass its budget</span><span class="h-chart__takeaway">At this pace transport ends October at KSh 12,860 against a KSh 12,000 limit.</span></figcaption><div class="h-chart__plot"><svg role="img" aria-label="Three budget bars for October so far. Groceries KSh 9,840 of KSh 25,000, projected KSh 25,420. Transport KSh 4,980 of KSh 12,000, projected KSh 12,860. Eating out KSh 1,450 of KSh 5,000, projected KSh 3,750." width="672" height="162" viewBox="0 0 672 162" data-chart="budget_bullets" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;font-family:var(--h-font)"><title>Three budget bars for October so f