><title>Transport: KSh 4,980 of KSh 12,000, projected KSh 12,860</title></path><line x1="192.47" x2="192.47" y1="68" y2="90" stroke="var(--h-ink)" stroke-width="2"></line><text x="296.2" y="84" font-size="14" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">42%</text><text x="288.2" y="66" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">Limit KSh 12,000</text><line x1="0" x2="328" y1="107.5" y2="107.5" stroke="var(--h-rule)" stroke-width="1" shape-rendering="crispEdges"></line></g><g><text x="0" y="138" font-size="14" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)">Eating out</text><rect x="110.5" y="126.5" width="177.2" height="13" fill="none" stroke="var(--h-rule)" stroke-width="1" shape-rendering="crispEdges"></rect><rect x="119.97" y="129" width="15.81" height="8" fill="none" stroke="var(--h-ink-soft)" stroke-width="1"></rect><path d="M110 126 H115.97 Q119.97 126 119.97 130 V136 Q119.97 140 115.97 140 H110 Z" fill="var(--h-out)"><title>Eating out: KSh 1,450 of KSh 5,000, projected KSh 3,750</title></path><line x1="144.36" x2="144.36" y1="122" y2="144" stroke="var(--h-ink)" stroke-width="2"></line><text x="296.2" y="138" font-size="14" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">29%</text><text x="288.2" y="120" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">Limit KSh 5,000</text></g></svg></div><p id="budgets-phone-alt" class="h-visually-hidden">Three budget bars for October so far. Groceries KSh 9,840 of KSh 25,000, projected KSh 25,420. Transport KSh 4,980 of KSh 12,000, projected KSh 12,860. Eating out KSh 1,450 of KSh 5,000, projected KSh 3,750.</p><details class="h-chart__data"><summary class="h-chart__toggle">Show the numbers</summary><table class="h-ledger h-ledger--compact"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Chart data: Transport is on course to pass its budget</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Category</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Spent</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Limit</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Projected</th><th scope="col" class="h-num"></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Groceries</th><td class="h-num">KSh 9,840</td><td class="h-num">KSh 25,000</td><td class="h-num">KSh 25,420</td><td class="h-num">39%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Transport</th><td class="h-num">KSh 4,980</td><td class="h-num">KSh 12,000</td><td class="h-num">KSh 12,860</td><td class="h-num">42%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eating out</th><td class="h-num">KSh 1,450</td><td class="h-num">KSh 5,000</td><td class="h-num">KSh 3,750</td><td class="h-num">29%</td></tr></tbody></table></details></figure></div></section><section class="h-section h-section--insights" aria-label="Worth knowing"><h2 class="h-section__title">Worth knowing</h2><ol class="h-insights"><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_w_07"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Two Safaricom payments a minute apart</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Two bundle purchases of the same amount landed one minute apart on Thursday. If one was a mistake, Safaricom can reverse it.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_w_05"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">Fuliza cost you KSh 87</h3><p class="h-insight__body">You drew KSh 1,500 on Fuliza and repaid KSh 1,200. Two days in overdraft cost KSh 87.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_w_06"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">KSh 4,000 sent to Mum</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Money sent to family and friends doubled compared with last week. It is counted as spending, not a transfer.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_w_08"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">A new place: Quickmart Kangemi</h3><p class="h-insight__body">First time Hesabu has seen Quickmart Kangemi. KSh 1,000 over two visits, filed under groceries.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_w_09"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">KSh 2,000 withdrawn as cash</h3><p class="h-insight__body">Cash is shown as a transfer. Matatu and boda fares you add by hand show up under transport.</p></li><li class="h-insight" data-insight-id="ci_w_10"><h3 class="h-insight__headline">You saved 43% of what came in</h3><p class="h-insight__body">KSh 5,000 went to M-Shwari from KSh 11,700 received. Savings are kept out of spending.</p></li></ol></section><section class="h-section h-section--chart" id="chart-balance_mpesa"><div class="h-chart-size h-chart-size--web"><figure class="h-chart" data-chart-id="balance_mpesa" style="max-width:672px;margin:0" aria-labelledby="balance_mpesa-title" aria-describedby="balance_mpesa-alt"><figcaption class="h-chart__caption"><span id="balance_mpesa-title" class="h-chart__title">M-Pesa ended the week at KSh 4,318</span></figcaption><div class="h-chart__plot"><svg role="img" aria-label="M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday." width="672" height="106" viewBox="0 0 672 106" data-chart="balance_sparkline" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;font-family:var(--h-font)"><title>M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday.</title><polygon points="0,86 0,27.56 97.05,14 194.09,43.43 291.14,50.28 388.19,37.35 485.23,46.1 582.28,55.82 582.28,86" fill="var(--h-ink)" opacity="0.08"></polygon><line x1="0" x2="582.28" y1="86" y2="86" stroke="var(--h-rule)" stroke-width="1" shape-rendering="crispEdges"></line><polyline points="0,27.56 97.05,14 194.09,43.43 291.14,50.28 388.19,37.35 485.23,46.1 582.28,55.82" fill="none" stroke="var(--h-ink)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"></polyline><g><rect x="0" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>5 Oct: KSh 8,360</title></rect></g><g><rect x="55.46" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>6 Oct: KSh 10,300</title></rect></g><g><rect x="152.5" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>7 Oct: KSh 6,090</title></rect></g><g><rect x="249.55" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>8 Oct: KSh 5,110</title></rect></g><g><rect x="346.6" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>9 Oct: KSh 6,960</title></rect></g><g><rect x="443.64" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>10 Oct: KSh 5,708</title></rect></g><g><rect x="540.69" y="14" width="83.18" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>11 Oct: KSh 4,318</title></rect></g><g><circle cx="582.28" cy="55.82" r="4" fill="var(--h-ink)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2"></circle><text x="592.28" y="60.82" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">KSh 4,318</text></g><text x="0" y="102" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)">5 Oct</text><text x="582.28" y="102" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)">11 Oct</text></svg></div><p id="balance_mpesa-alt" class="h-visually-hidden">M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday.</p><details class="h-chart__data"><summary class="h-chart__toggle">Show the numbers</summary><table class="h-ledger h-ledger--compact"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Chart data: M-Pesa ended the week at KSh 4,318</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Balance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">5 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 8,360</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 10,300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 6,090</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 5,110</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 6,960</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 5,708</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">11 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 4,318</td></tr></tbody></table></details></figure></div><div class="h-chart-size h-chart-size--phone"><figure class="h-chart" data-chart-id="balance_mpesa-phone" style="max-width:328px;margin:0" aria-labelledby="balance_mpesa-phone-title" aria-describedby="balance_mpesa-phone-alt"><figcaption class="h-chart__caption"><span id="balance_mpesa-phone-title" class="h-chart__title">M-Pesa ended the week at KSh 4,318</span></figcaption><div class="h-chart__plot"><svg role="img" aria-label="M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday." width="328" height="106" viewBox="0 0 328 106" data-chart="balance_sparkline" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;font-family:var(--h-font)"><title>M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday.</title><polygon points="0,86 0,27.56 39.71,14 79.43,43.43 119.14,50.28 158.85,37.35 198.57,46.1 238.28,55.82 238.28,86" fill="var(--h-ink)" opacity="0.08"></polygon><line x1="0" x2="238.28" y1="86" y2="86" stroke="var(--h-rule)" stroke-width="1" shape-rendering="crispEdges"></line><polyline points="0,27.56 39.71,14 79.43,43.43 119.14,50.28 158.85,37.35 198.57,46.1 238.28,55.82" fill="none" stroke="var(--h-ink)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"></polyline><g><rect x="0" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>5 Oct: KSh 8,360</title></rect></g><g><rect x="22.69" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>6 Oct: KSh 10,300</title></rect></g><g><rect x="62.41" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>7 Oct: KSh 6,090</title></rect></g><g><rect x="102.12" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>8 Oct: KSh 5,110</title></rect></g><g><rect x="141.83" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>9 Oct: KSh 6,960</title></rect></g><g><rect x="181.55" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>10 Oct: KSh 5,708</title></rect></g><g><rect x="221.26" y="14" width="34.04" height="72" fill="transparent"><title>11 Oct: KSh 4,318</title></rect></g><g><circle cx="238.28" cy="55.82" r="4" fill="var(--h-ink)" stroke="var(--h-sheet)" stroke-width="2"></circle><text x="248.28" y="60.82" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink)" font-family="var(--h-font)" data-numeric="">KSh 4,318</text></g><text x="0" y="102" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)">5 Oct</text><text x="238.28" y="102" font-size="12" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="auto" fill="var(--h-ink-soft)" font-family="var(--h-font)">11 Oct</text></svg></div><p id="balance_mpesa-phone-alt" class="h-visually-hidden">M-Pesa balance over the week, from KSh 2,840 spent on Monday to a closing balance of KSh 4,318 on Sunday.</p><details class="h-chart__data"><summary class="h-chart__toggle">Show the numbers</summary><table class="h-ledger h-ledger--compact"><caption class="h-visually-hidden">Chart data: M-Pesa ended the week at KSh 4,318</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col" class="h-num">Balance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">5 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 8,360</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 10,300</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 6,090</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 5,110</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 6,960</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 5,708</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">11 Oct</th><td class="h-num">KSh 4,318</td></tr></tbody></table></details></figure></div></section><section class="h-section h-section--watch" aria-label="Three things to watch next week"><h2 class="h-section__title">Three things to watch next week</h2><ol class="h-watch"><li>Safaricom Home Fibre is due on 15 October, usually KSh 2,999.</li><li>Transport is projected to reach KSh 12,860, past its KSh 12,000 budget.</li><li>Your M-Pesa balance is KSh 4,318. Fuliza kicks in again if it runs out before Friday.</li></ol></section><aside class="h-callout h-callout--neutral" role="note"><p>3 messages could not be read. Open Hesabu to teach it what they were.</p></aside><footer class="h-footer"><p class="h-footer__note">Every number is computed from your money messages. Nothing is estimated.</p><dl class="h-footer__meta"><div><dt>Accounts covered</dt><dd>M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari</dd></div><div><dt>Messages Hesabu could not read</dt><dd class="h-num">3</dd></div><div><dt>Report generated</dt><dd>2026-10-11</dd></div></dl><p class="h-footer__writer">Written without AI: numbers only.</p><p class="h-footer__link"><a class="h-button" href="https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture">Open in Hesabu</a></p></footer></div></article></main></div>
