ns-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Yafaa kujua</p><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Malipo mawili ya Safaricom ndani ya dakika moja</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Ununuzi mbili za bando za kiasi kile kile ziliingia dakika moja baada ya nyingine Alhamisi. Kama moja ilikuwa kosa, Safaricom wanaweza kuirudisha.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Fuliza ilikugharimu KSh 87</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Ulichukua KSh 1,500 kwa Fuliza na ukalipa KSh 1,200. Siku mbili za deni ziligharimu KSh 87.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">KSh 4,000 zilitumwa kwa Mama</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Pesa ulizotuma kwa familia na marafiki ziliongezeka maradufu ikilinganishwa na wiki iliyopita. Zinahesabiwa kama matumizi, si uhamisho.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Sehemu mpya: Quickmart Kangemi</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Mara ya kwanza Hesabu kuona Quickmart Kangemi. KSh 1,000 kwa ziara mbili, chini ya mboga na chakula.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">KSh 2,000 zilitolewa taslimu</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Pesa taslimu zinaonyeshwa kama uhamisho. Nauli za matatu na boda unazoongeza mwenyewe zinaonekana chini ya usafiri.</p></div><div style="margin-bottom:16px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Uliweka akiba 43% ya zilizoingia</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:4px">KSh 5,000 zilienda M-Shwari kati ya KSh 11,700 ulizopokea. Akiba haihesabiwi kama matumizi.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0">M-Pesa ilifunga wiki na KSh 4,318</p><img src="cid:balance_mpesa" width="552" alt="Salio la M-Pesa wiki nzima, kutoka KSh 2,840 zilizotumika Jumatatu hadi salio la mwisho la KSh 4,318 Jumapili." style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:552px;height:auto;margin-top:12px;border:0"/></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:32px"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:500;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px">Mambo matatu ya kuangalia wiki ijayo</p><ol style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;padding-left:24px"><li style="margin-top:8px">Safaricom Home Fibre inatarajiwa tarehe 15 Oktoba, kwa kawaida KSh 2,999.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Usafiri unakadiriwa kufikia KSh 12,860, zaidi ya bajeti yake ya KSh 12,000.</li><li style="margin-top:8px">Salio lako la M-Pesa ni KSh 4,318. Fuliza itaanza tena likiisha kabla ya Ijumaa.</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;background-color:#F3F5F7;border-left:3px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0">Jumbe 3 hazikusomeka. Fungua Hesabu uifundishe zilikuwa nini.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:48px;border-top:1px solid #C9D2DC"><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#141E2E;margin:0;margin-top:16px">Kila nambari imehesabiwa kutoka kwa jumbe zako za pesa. Hakuna makadirio.</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:8px">Akaunti zilizojumuishwa: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari</p><p style="font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:400;color:#5B6878;margin:0;margin-top:4px">Jumbe ambazo Hesabu haikuweza kusoma: 3</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;color:#141E2E;padding-top:24px"><a href="https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;background-color:#1F4FD8;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&#x27;Schibsted Grotesk&#x27;, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px">Ripoti kamili</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for weekly-sw > email HTML is table-based with cid images and a text twin 2`] = `
"Hesabu, Ripoti ya wiki, 5 hadi 11 Oktoba 2026

Wiki yako kwa pesa
------------------

Jumatatu                         KSh 2,840
Jumanne                          KSh 1,560
Jumatano                         KSh 4,210
Alhamisi                           KSh 980
Ijumaa                           KSh 6,350
Jumamosi                         KSh 3,120
Jumapili                         KSh 1,390
Jumla ya matumizi               KSh 20,450
KSh 1,550 zaidi ya wiki iliyopita

Ulitumia 8% zaidi ya wiki iliyopita, hasa kwa mboga na pesa ulizotuma nyumbani.

Zilizoingia: KSh 11,700 (KSh -26,300)
Zilizotoka: KSh 20,450 (KSh +1,550)
Ada: KSh 312 (KSh +47)
Salio la wiki: KSh -9,062

Zilizoingia zilipungua baada ya mshahara wa wiki iliyopita; matumizi yalibaki vilevile
Miraba miwili inalinganisha wiki hii na iliyopita. Wiki hii: KSh 11,700 ziliingia, KSh 20,450 zilitoka, salio KSh -9,062. Wiki iliyopita: KSh 38,000 ziliingia, KSh 18,900 zilitoka, salio KSh 18,835.

Mboga na chakula zilichukua 30% ya wiki
Donati ya matumizi ya KSh 20,450 kwa kategoria. Mboga na chakula KSh 6,120 (30%), familia na marafiki KSh 4,000 (20%), usafiri KSh 3,480 (17%), umeme na maji KSh 3,200 (16%), kula nje KSh 1,450, airtime na data KSh 1,150, mengineyo KSh 1,050.

Ijumaa ndiyo siku uliyotumia zaidi, KSh 6,350
Miraba saba, mmoja kwa kila siku, na mstari wa wastani wa KSh 2,921. Jumatatu KSh 2,840, Jumanne KSh 1,560, Jumatano KSh 4,210, Alhamisi KSh 980, Ijumaa KSh 6,350, Jumamosi KSh 3,120, Jumapili KSh 1,390.

Pesa zilienda wapi
------------------
Mboga na chakula  |  KSh 6,120  |  30%  |  KSh +640
Familia na marafiki  |  KSh 4,000  |  20%  |  KSh +2,000
Usafiri  |  KSh 3,480  |  17%  |  KSh -420
Umeme na maji  |  KSh 3,200  |  16%  |  KSh +1,200
Kula nje  |  KSh 1,450  |  7%  |  KSh -860
Airtime na data  |  KSh 1,150  |  6%  |  KSh -160
Mengineyo  |  KSh 1,050  |  5%  |  KSh -850
Jumla  |  KSh 20,450  |    |  KSh +1,550

Naivas ndiyo duka kubwa zaidi, KSh 3,860
Miraba ya kulala ya maduka nane ya juu. Naivas Westlands KSh 3,860, KPLC prepaid KSh 2,000, Total Energies Parklands KSh 1,800, Matatu and boda (cash) KSh 1,680, Mama Mboga Kangemi KSh 1,260, Nairobi Water KSh 1,200, Safaricom KSh 1,150, Quickmart Kangemi KSh 1,000 (mpya).

Watu
----
Mum  |  KSh 4,000  |  KSh 0
Jane Wanjiru  |  KSh 0  |  KSh 3,500

Ada zilichukua 2% ya ulichotumia
Mstari mfupi wenye mistari: ada za KSh 312 ni 2% ya KSh 20,450 zilizotumika.

> KSh 312 zilienda kwa ada wiki hii, KSh 87 kati yake ni gharama ya Fuliza kwa siku 2 ukiwa na deni.

Zilizohamishwa, si matumizi
---------------------------
Kwenda M-Shwari  |  KSh 5,000
Pesa taslimu ulizotoa  |  KSh 2,000
Fuliza ulizolipa  |  KSh 1,200
Jumla zilizohamishwa  |  KSh 7,000

Usafiri unaelekea kupita bajeti yake
Miraba mitatu ya bajeti kwa Oktoba hadi sasa. Mboga na chakula KSh 9,840 kati ya KSh 25,000, makadirio KSh 25,420. Usafiri KSh 4,980 kati ya KSh 12,000, makadirio KSh 12,860. Kula nje KSh 1,450 kati ya KSh 5,000, makadirio KSh 3,750.

Yafaa kujua
-----------
- Malipo mawili ya Safaricom ndani ya dakika moja
  Ununuzi mbili za bando za kiasi kile kile ziliingia dakika moja baada ya nyingine Alhamisi. Kama moja ilikuwa kosa, Safaricom wanaweza kuirudisha.
- Fuliza ilikugharimu KSh 87
  Ulichukua KSh 1,500 kwa Fuliza na ukalipa KSh 1,200. Siku mbili za deni ziligharimu KSh 87.
- KSh 4,000 zilitumwa kwa Mama
  Pesa ulizotuma kwa familia na marafiki ziliongezeka maradufu ikilinganishwa na wiki iliyopita. Zinahesabiwa kama matumizi, si uhamisho.
- Sehemu mpya: Quickmart Kangemi
  Mara ya kwanza Hesabu kuona Quickmart Kangemi. KSh 1,000 kwa ziara mbili, chini ya mboga na chakula.
- KSh 2,000 zilitolewa taslimu
  Pesa taslimu zinaonyeshwa kama uhamisho. Nauli za matatu na boda unazoongeza mwenyewe zinaonekana chini ya usafiri.
- Uliweka akiba 43% ya zilizoingia
  KSh 5,000 zilienda M-Shwari kati ya KSh 11,700 ulizopokea. Akiba haihesabiwi kama matumizi.

M-Pesa ilifunga wiki na KSh 4,318
Salio la M-Pesa wiki nzima, kutoka KSh 2,840 zilizotumika Jumatatu hadi salio la mwisho la KSh 4,318 Jumapili.

Mambo matatu ya kuangalia wiki ijayo
------------------------------------
1. Safaricom Home Fibre inatarajiwa tarehe 15 Oktoba, kwa kawaida KSh 2,999.
2. Usafiri unakadiriwa kufikia KSh 12,860, zaidi ya bajeti yake ya KSh 12,000.
3. Salio lako la M-Pesa ni KSh 4,318. Fuliza itaanza tena likiisha kabla ya Ijumaa.

> Jumbe 3 hazikusomeka. Fungua Hesabu uifundishe zilikuwa nini.

Kila nambari imehesabiwa kutoka kwa jumbe zako za pesa. Hakuna makadirio.
Akaunti zilizojumuishwa: M-Pesa 0712***456, KCB current ***890, M-Shwari
Jumbe ambazo Hesabu haikuweza kusoma: 3

Ripoti kamili: https://hesabu.test/r/token-fixture"
`;

exports[`HTML outputs for weekly-sw > hero HTML carries the tally, three insight lines and the donut 1`] = `
"<!doctype html>
